# Inventory Management System

## Key Models
- [Inventory Model](mdc:app/Models/Inventory.php): The main model for inventory items with relationships to rooms, laboratories, and users.
- User Model: Stores user information with fields like first_name and last_name.

## Controllers
- [InventoryController](mdc:app/Http/Controllers/Admin/InventoryController.php): Handles CRUD operations for inventory items including index, create, store, edit, update, delete.

## Frontend Components
- [Inventory Index Page](mdc:resources/js/Pages/Inventory/Index.jsx): Displays the inventory list with filtering, pagination, and management options.

## Data Relationships
- Inventory belongsTo Laboratory
- Inventory belongsTo Room
- Inventory belongsTo User (as creator)
- Inventory hasMany InventoryGallery

## UI Display Guidelines
- When displaying a user's name, combine first_name and last_name: `${user.first_name} ${user.last_name}`
- When loading inventory data, always include the related models: `with(['room', 'laboratory', 'creator', 'galleries'])`
